    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Farrell Auctioneers, Valuers & Estate Agents Ltd bring to the market this bungalow residence which is located in the town land of Drummin which is approx. 9km from Gort town,. The property is set on approx. 3.97 acres and contained in Folio GY103164F.\n\nThe residence has been constructed around mobile home structure and accommodation includes in the mobile home area; 3 bedrooms, sitting/kitchen/dining area, shower room and w.c. The main house consists of a tv room, kitchen, 2 bedrooms, storage room, bathroom and attached garage. The dwelling is in good condition. Heating is oil fired central hearing and windows and doors appear to be in good condition. Services are connected to the property. \n\nTo arrange to view the property please contact our office on 091 - 632688."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front Porch Area - 5.3m (17'5\") x 1.4m (4'7\")\n\nEntrance Hallway - 1.25m (4'1\") x 1.3m (4'3\")\nThis area has tiled flooring, recess lighting and t & g pine ceilings\n\nSitting Room - 5.35m (17'7\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nThis area has tiled flooring and double aspect windows\n\nKitchen - 3.6m (11'10\") x 2.4m (7'10\")\nThis area has tiled flooring, fitted kitchen units, integrated appliances, t&g wooden effect ceiling and feature light fittings\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m (12'10\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nThis room has wood effect laminate flooring and N.E facing windows,\n\nStorage Room - 3.4m (11'2\") x 1.5m (4'11\")\n\nInternal Hallway - 4.5m (14'9\") x 1.05m (3'5\")\nThis area has tiled flooring,\n\nInternal Hallway - 2.3m (7'7\") x 1.25m (4'1\")\nThis area has tiled flooring\n\nBathroom - 2.5m (8'2\") x 2.1m (6'11\")\nThis area is tiled floor to 3/4 wall and contains w.c, w.h.b, urinal, corner shower units, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, mirrored storage cabinet and towel radiator.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m (12'6\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nThis room has wood effect laminate flooring\n\nAttached Garage - 5.6m (18'4\") x 5.3m (17'5\")\nThe garage is a double car garage, the oil boiler is located here and there is also attic access\n\nMobile Home\n\nEntrance Porch - 1m (3'3\") x 0.8m (2'7\")\n\nW.C - 1.2m (3'11\") x 0.9m (2'11\")\n\nInternally Hallway - 3.2m (10'6\") x 0.85m (2'9\")\n\nKitchen/Dining/Living ARea - 5.2m (17'1\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.4m (7'10\") x 1.8m (5'11\")\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.1m (10'2\") x 2m (6'7\")\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.2m (7'3\") x 1.6m (5'3\")\n\nShower Room - 1.8m (5'11\") x 1m (3'3\")\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 5 Bedroom home </li><li> Residence has been constructed around a mobile home </li><li> Set on approx. 3.9 Acres </li><li> Water - Private Well </li><li> Sanitation - Via Septic Tank </li><li> Heating O.F.C.H </li><li> Located approx. 9km from Gort town</li></ul>"
      },
